            id: "exp_2", title: "Struktur Data: Array, Stack, Queue", icon: "📚", difficulty: "Sulit", duration: "45 menit",
            content: `<div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-purple-600 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><span>📚</span> Struktur Data Fundamental</h3><div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border-2 border-purple-100"><h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600">📖 Cara Menyusun Data Efisien</h4><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Struktur data menentukan CARA data disimpan dan diakses di memori. Pemilihan yang tepat bisa membuat algoritma 1000x lebih cepat. Setiap struktur punya trade-off: cepat baca tapi lambat insert, atau sebaliknya.</p></div><div class="bg-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl text-sm font-mono leading-relaxed"><p class="text-slate-400"># Stack (LIFO — Last In First Out) seperti tumpukan piring</p><p class="text-yellow-400">class Stack:</p><p class="text-green-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;def __init__(self): self.items = []</p><p class="text-green-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;def push(self, item): self.items.append(item)</p><p class="text-green-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;def pop(self): return self.items.pop()</p><p class="text-green-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;def peek(self): return self.items[-1]</p><p class="text-green-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;def is_empty(self): return len(self.items) == 0</p><br><p class="text-slate-400"># Queue (FIFO — First In First Out) seperti antrian kasir</p><p class="text-yellow-400">from collections import deque</p><p class="text-yellow-400">antrian = deque()</p><p class="text-yellow-400">antrian.append(<span class="text-green-400">"Andi"</span>) <span class="text-slate-400"># Enqueue (masuk)</span></p><p class="text-yellow-400">antrian.append(<span class="text-green-400">"Budi"</span>)</p><p class="text-yellow-400">keluar = antrian.popleft() <span class="text-slate-400"># Dequeue: "Andi" (keluar duluan)</span></p><br><p class="text-slate-400"># Linked List — Node berantai</p><p class="text-yellow-400">class Node:</p><p class="text-green-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;def __init__(self, data):</p><p class="text-green-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;self.data = data</p><p class="text-green-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;self.next = None <span class="text-slate-400"># Pointer ke node berikutnya</span></p></div><div class="bg-purple-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-100 mt-4"><h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600">🧩 Perbandingan Kompleksitas</h4><table class="w-full text-sm text-slate-700"><tr class="border-b"><th class="text-left py-1">Operasi</th><th>Array</th><th>Stack</th><th>Queue</th><th>Linked List</th></tr><tr class="border-b"><td class="py-1">Akses index</td><td class="text-center">O(1)</td><td class="text-center">O(n)</td><td class="text-center">O(n)</td><td class="text-center">O(n)</td></tr><tr class="border-b"><td class="py-1">Insert awal</td><td class="text-center">O(n)</td><td class="text-center">—</td><td class="text-center">—</td><td class="text-center">O(1)</td></tr><tr class="border-b"><td class="py-1">Insert akhir</td><td class="text-center">O(1)*</td><td class="text-center">O(1)</td><td class="text-center">O(1)</td><td class="text-center">O(n)</td></tr><tr><td class="py-1">Cari elemen</td><td class="text-center">O(n)</td><td class="text-center">O(n)</td><td class="text-center">O(n)</td><td class="text-center">O(n)</td></tr></table></div></div>`,
