            content: `<div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-purple-600 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2"><span>🏆</span> Proyek Master: Full-Stack AI Application</h3><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-purple-50 rounded-3xl p-6 border-2 border-indigo-100 shadow-sm"><h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider text-indigo-700">🎓 Gabungkan Semuanya!</h4><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700 mb-4">Bangun aplikasi web cerdas end-to-end dengan arsitektur modern:</p></div><div class="bg-slate-800 p-5 rounded-2xl text-sm font-mono leading-relaxed"><p class="text-slate-400"># Arsitektur Proyek</p><p class="text-cyan-400">[React Frontend]</p><p class="text-slate-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;↓ fetch('/api/predict')</p><p class="text-cyan-400">[Express/FastAPI Backend]</p><p class="text-slate-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;↓ ORM query &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ↓ model.predict()</p><p class="text-cyan-400">[PostgreSQL DB] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [ML Model (pkl/h5)]</p><p class="text-slate-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;↑</p><p class="text-cyan-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[Docker Container]</p><p class="text-slate-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;↓</p><p class="text-cyan-400">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;[Vercel / Railway]</p></div><div class="bg-purple-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-100 mt-4"><h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-600">🧩 Step-by-Step Guide</h4><ol class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-700 list-decimal list-inside"><li><strong>Data & Model:</strong> Kumpulkan dataset → EDA (Pandas) → Feature Engineering → Train model (sklearn/TF) → Simpan ke file (.pkl/.h5)</li><li><strong>Backend API:</strong> FastAPI/Express → Load model → Buat endpoint POST /api/predict → Terima input JSON, return prediksi</li><li><strong>Database:</strong> PostgreSQL → Simpan history prediksi, user data → ORM (Prisma/SQLAlchemy)</li><li><strong>Frontend:</strong> React → Form input → Fetch ke backend → Tampilkan hasil prediksi secara visual (grafik, kartu)</li><li><strong>Auth:</strong> JWT login → Protected routes → Bcrypt password hashing</li><li><strong>Docker:</strong> Dockerfile untuk backend → docker-compose.yml (app + db + redis)</li><li><strong>CI/CD:</strong> GitHub Actions → Test → Build → Deploy ke Vercel (frontend) + Railway (backend)</li><li><strong>Testing:</strong> Unit test API endpoint → Integration test model → E2E test flow</li></ol></div><div class="bg-indigo-100 p-4 rounded-xl border border-indigo-200 mt-4"><p class="text-sm font-bold text-indigo-900">🎓 <strong>SELAMAT!</strong> Jika kamu memahami semua konsep dari Level 1 hingga Level 6 Expert, kamu telah memiliki fondasi kuat untuk menjadi <strong>Software Engineer</strong> dan <strong>AI Practitioner</strong> profesional. Teruslah belajar — dunia teknologi tidak pernah berhenti berkembang! 🚀</p></div></div>`,
